assertion  XBD.sys_utsname.h.001
anchor     basedefs/sys_utsname.h.html#DESCRIPTION/utsname
class      required
since      1988
says       After uname() succeeds, each of the members sysname, nodename,
           release, version and machine of the structure holds a string ended by
           a null byte inside the array.
test       t/001-uname-strings.c
nomutant   run-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
